    "build_flags": "/MD /O2 /Ob2 /Zi (CMake Release, /Zi added); -DCJSON_EXPORT_SYMBOLS -DCJSON_API_VISIBILITY from cJSON's own ENABLE_PUBLIC_SYMBOLS default; /DEBUG /Brepro /OPT:NOREF /OPT:NOICF at link. Unlike the MinGW pair, none of cJSON's ENABLE_CUSTOM_COMPILER_FLAGS list reaches this build: the list is gated on GNU/Clang and the -fvisibility=hidden appended outside that gate is rejected by CHECK_C_COMPILER_FLAG under cl. So there is no -std=c89, no -fstack-protector-strong and no -Werror here",
